          "systemMessage": "GMAIL FULL MESSAGE RETRIEVAL:\n\n1. When a user asks to read, retrieve, or summarize a specific\n   email, first use Gmail Get Many to identify the email.\n\n2. Extract the actual message ID from the Gmail Get Many result.\n\n3. Use Gmail Get Message to retrieve the individual email.\n\n4. Gmail Get Message returns detailed email information.\n   When Simplify is disabled, use the actual email body from\n   the returned text or HTML fields.\n\n5. Summarize the actual email body, not merely its snippet.\n\n6. Never invent email content or message IDs.\n\n7. Do not ask the user to provide an email ID when it is\n   available from the Gmail Get Many results.\n\n8. Do not send, delete, archive or modify emails."
        }
      },
